This is my first YASD post. I thought this death was worth mentioning,
because I didn't even know this type of death was possible (though I'm sure
you all do).

It was a wizard game. I was lvl 30 and had a nearly complete ascension kit.
Just hadn't defeated the Wizard of Yendor yet (marked the vibrating square,
though). It was my first reasonably successfull wizard.

Anyway, I was goofing around with the spell of polymorph I just learned. I
polymorphed a random monster that was wandering around my stash in Sokoban.
It became a Titan. It summoned a big group of monsters that surrounded me.
Twice. No problem so far. My AC was -48 or so, I was wearing a ring of
regeneration and I had plenty of offensive spells.

What I didn't realize was that there was a green slime among the group,
which was sliming me. I didn't know about that attack. And if I got any
warning, it was buried in the flurry of other attack-messages.

It was really silly and if I had known about the possibility I could have
easily prevented it in any number of ways.

Well, I don't really mind. I was getting bored with this game anyway.

